 100 100       Swidth(m), Slength(m)
     3 5.78E-03       nbcroff, bcropeak(m3/s)
     0 0              Beginning of triangular runoff
 12135 5.78E-03       time to runoff meak = entime/2.67
 32400 0              end runoff time (9 * 3600s)
------------------------------------------------------------------
SWIDTH      Source area width (m)
SLENGTH     Source area flow path length (m)
NBCROFF     (integer) number of time steps of the incoming field hydrograph Default 2
BCROPEAK    peak flow of the incoming triangular field hydrograph (m3/s)
BCROFF(I,J) incoming field hydrograph: flow rate, time (s) vs. qin(m3/s).
BCROPEAK    Triangular peak runoff rate(m3/s) = 2*[RunoffVolume (mm/h) * (1 m/1000mm) * (1h/3600 sec)] * [A(ha) * (10000 m2/ha)]
BCPEAKTIME  Triangular peak runoff time (s)= DR2/2.67 (see below) 
DR2         End time (s) = Duration (h) * 3600 s/h

Original:
